{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e06-scene-15",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "敌可化友的道理  (Turning Rivals Into Friends)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "fang": "方老师"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Over freshly brewed tea at Media College, Professor Fang explains to Bu Xiaogu how the reversible opening phrase of an ancient Chinese classic captures the art of turning rivals into allies. Listen to Professor Fang in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "老子五千言，核心的精神是辩证二字。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "开篇的头一句就是道可道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "在我看来，从表面的形式上已经说明了辩证的道理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你看，这句话倒过来读，意思也是完全一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "万物之理，永不凝固。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "天道循环，阴阳反背。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "亲可成仇，敌可化友。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "黑与白，在灰度不同的对局之下，有时是完全颠覆的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "所以啊，做一件事情的成败。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "有时取决于你从哪个角度出发去想。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "老子五千言，核心的精神是辩证二字。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Across Laozi's five thousand words, the core spirit lies in dialectics.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "开篇的头一句就是道可道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The very opening phrase at the start is Dao Ke Dao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "在我看来，从表面的形式上已经说明了辩证的道理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In my view, its surface form already illustrates that dialectical principle.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你看，这句话倒过来读，意思也是完全一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look: if you read those three characters backwards, the meaning stays exactly the same.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "万物之理，永不凝固。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The pattern of all things never freezes in place.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "天道循环，阴阳反背。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Heaven's way moves in cycles, and yin and yang turn into their opposites.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "亲可成仇，敌可化友。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Close allies can become foes, and enemies can be turned into friends.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "黑与白，在灰度不同的对局之下，有时是完全颠覆的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Black and white, across games of shifting shades of grey, can sometimes reverse completely.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "所以啊，做一件事情的成败。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And so, whether an endeavour succeeds or fails—'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "有时取决于你从哪个角度出发去想。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'sometimes depends on the angle from which you choose to think.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "老子五千言，核心的精神是辩证二字。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "开篇的头一句就是道可道。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "在我看来，从表面的形式上已经说明了辩证的道理。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你看，这句话倒过来读，意思也是完全一样。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "万物之理，永不凝固。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "天道循环，阴阳反背。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "亲可成仇，敌可化友。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "黑与白，在灰度不同的对局之下，有时是完全颠覆的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "所以啊，做一件事情的成败。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "有时取决于你从哪个角度出发去想。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Professor Fang's lesson on turning enemies into friends plants the exact clue Bu Xiaogu needs to understand Chun Yuqiao's next move. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
